      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An Al2O3-based or Al2O3/Cr2O3 coating will inhibit oxygen ingress into equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
